{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "3a52a9c2afe63287ef01ad5a620e7a7def166bbb996e96be095211f90f39679b", "ja": "{$P$}。ちょっといい？\nこの間のミルキーウェイ公演のことなんだけど。", "zh": "{$P$}，你有空吗？\n关于之前的『Milky Way』公演，我有事情想问你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7a84bf6f54fcafc9276b5b34f9a586bbe43ddcb6cbccd87a8632ef1306867663", "ja": "ああ、昴か。ちょうど俺も報告書を書いてたところだ。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "哎呀，是昴啊。刚好我也在写报告。\n你要问什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "6290986e30575566ea8fdb950d7a05c346a954c5896d084c3f5c4af74a3b8369", "ja": "えっと……オレさ、公演の前に、\nお客さんにブログ書いてたじゃん？", "zh": "就是……我在公演之前，\n不是有写部落格给粉丝看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "6646808c577f6d3932582436f909841812aadd7070adc348b8a0ba7029c3336f", "ja": "今見返したら、すっごいライブにするって、\nホームラン予告しちゃってたんだけど……。", "zh": "现在回去看那篇文章，我那时说要办场很棒的演唱会，\n等同是做了全垒打宣言……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "d0f816379230fcee993dc3a7424cfb63965dbcba95a73cd67178fa0a87f88894", "ja": "なんか、ちょっと心配になってきちゃって……。\nファンのみんな、本当にちゃんと喜んでくれたのかな？", "zh": "但我现在开始担心起来了……\n粉丝们真的看得很开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2442279394d337176bfe141058f677d8e45c63e19b82ac0f54a4812c4c19a21e", "ja": "え？　今になって、急にどうしたんだ？\nライブは場外ホームラン級に盛り上がったじゃないか？", "zh": "什么？你怎么现在才突然问这个？\n演唱会时观众不是像敲出场外全垒打一样嗨吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "909812939f51d229569a722ed1d3f0cfa090455193649ef0502dacf8d06a490e", "ja": "だってオレ、黒井社長みたいな変な大人って\n初めてだったし、じつは結構びびちゃってて……。", "zh": "因为我是第一次遇到像黑井社长那种奇怪的大人啊，\n老实说我有点吓到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2add5b951320c86be83af2c574cda3dd91c689468ec39f141107f4561db1e867", "ja": "まあ、確かにああいう人には、\nあんまり会わないよな……。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n像他那种人确实不常见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c7a5b86733b611cc1eafd53d8b5a8fccf8d8c904eb2f32096b3daff68af78369", "ja": "でも大丈夫だよ。本番のステージでの昴たちは元気\nいっぱいで、お客さん達もとっても楽しそうだったぞ！", "zh": "不过你放心。昴，你们在正式表演中非常有活力，\n观众看起来也很享受喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "aaca5dc412607a2eddd2f80cac5108715af2b1db6d90b6f6c10354dd24b507da", "ja": "そっか……そうだった気がする！\nうん、サンキュ、{$P$}！", "zh": "这样啊……我也这么觉得！\n嗯，谢啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "cb2059786d6c0b160603875ed9dbb2209720dea46ba4eecc00714f6c968f9d96", "ja": "オレ、なんか{$P$}に助けられて\nばっかだよなー。あの時もそうだったし……。", "zh": "我好像老是受到{$P$}帮助耶，\n那个时候也一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7cf33a4caef1d0a00806860fdc8f317bb84bbc8d28a667c19b1b2221cef34052", "ja": "あの時？", "zh": "那个时候？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "2a0cb603be2440fb3cb948324d2710f35dcc5d8c3672c12dc3c9aa5b356c9a6a", "ja": "ほら、始球式の時！\n黒井社長の好きにはさせないって、言ってくれただろ？", "zh": "就是开球典礼啊！\n你不是说不会让黑井社长为所欲为吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "7ff474df7810c2337f8299d6240b7d6c6aa255646775d0eea5c73bd1d82f324c", "ja": "オレ、すっげー感動しちゃってさ！\nそれで、ビシッと全力投球できたんだー。", "zh": "那时候我超感动的！\n所以才能用尽全力开球喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "32217d7ef4eb707da34b0c243edfed1da0c1c22e869b893c86981ec3e6b268a7", "ja": "あの時の{$P$}って、\nなんかヒーローみたいだったぜ！", "zh": "那时候的{$P$}，\n感觉就像是个英雄一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6f3d91628f126ce8346a91943a37456724d1e8f55c827a5e2848f93759eb0358", "ja": "はは、それは大げさじゃないか？", "zh": "哈哈，这就说得太夸张了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "94c24f88d8af24a92b96f41871380731b4128f828b8de26cd429c071704b49f5", "ja": "そんなことないよ！　すっげーカッコよくて、なんか…\nオレ、ドキドキしたっていうか……えっと……。", "zh": "才不会呢！你那时候超帅的，而且……\n我好像还有点心跳加速了……呃呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "3e4590775ae3444c403ff89d3f27257995f32b330a965e6d9b21606307b330f6", "ja": "と、とにかく、かっこよかったんだってば！\nだからさっ。", "zh": "反、反正，你那时很帅气就对了！\n所以啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0053_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "4d3e4278f2403e5879b88f9942dc0689e54ab1296ff9857ae3fc5a2efba769ee", "ja": "これからも頼りにしてるぜ、\n{$P$}♪", "zh": "以后也要拜托你照顾啰，\n{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
